  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Substituting&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the expression becomes<br /><math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an increasing function.<br />Maximum value <math><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
